00:03:42.087 --> 00:03:43.771
vi hobn zey geheysn?

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:44.999
Alter un Pesye.

00:03:45.158 --> 00:03:48.560
zey zenen geven di eltern fun dayn foter ober day-

00:03:47.115 --> 00:03:48.594
