zi iz in NEW YORK.

00:04:19.853 --> 00:04:22.294
als, als kleyn kind

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:26.360
kenstu gedenken dayne g-, dayne bobe, dayn zeyd-

00:04:25.135 --> 00:04:27.022
NO. zey zenen avekgeforn

00:04:27.022 --> 00:04:28.453
fun mayn foter?

00:04:28.611 --> 00:04:31.895
zey zenen gekumen in Amerike ven ikh bin nokh geven a kleyner kind.

00:04:31.767 --> 00:04:33.651
