00:04:41.841 --> 00:04:43.708
un di eltern fun dayn mame.

00:04:46.144 --> 00:04:47.943
⟨NO⟩, ikh denk az zey lebn nisht.

00:04:46.279 --> 00:04:47.268
zenen z-

00:04:48.355 --> 00:04:49.226
NO

00:04:48.523 --> 00:04:51.099
zenen zey oykhet gekumen nokh Amerike?

00:04:50.177 --> 00:04:51.757
NO. NO.

00:04:53.097 --> 00:04:57.377
zog mir fun dayn shtot. vos far a shtot iz Sokolov gevezn?

00:04:59.357 --> 00:05:00.785
a yidishe shtot.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.725
s'iz geven a groyse shtot bay di

00:05:07.238 --> 00:05:09.324
fun di STATE, WAS Lublin.

00:05:09.651 --> 00:05:12.108
t- THE STATE UNK CITY.

00:05:12.975 --> 00:05:16.192
vos gedenkstu fun Sokolov? vos kenstu mir zogn?

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:18.791
vi es hot oysgezen?

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:22.031
gornisht. m'iz ganen

00:05:22.273 --> 00:05:25.608
in di PUBLIC SCHOOL, un AFTER SCHOOL fleg men geyn in kheyder

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.073
un bay nakht fleg men geyn in shul.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:29.675
un in der fri.

00:05:30.694 --> 00:05:33.422
vos far a hoyz hostu gehat als kind?

00:05:35.082 --> 00:05:36.544
s'iz geven a

00:05:36.921 --> 00:05:40.509
tsvey APA- tsvey voynungen. eyne iz gevezn far undz

00:05:40.515 --> 00:05:42.618
un eyne iz gevezn a halbe

00:05:42.658 --> 00:05:44.440
m'hot geUSED far a

00:05:44.515 --> 00:05:46.281
far a minyen far a shul.

00:05:46.641 --> 00:05:49.633
un mayn zeyde hot undz geshikt di gelt fun CHICAGO

00:05:49.633 --> 00:05:51.157
tsu koyfn dort

00:05:51.771 --> 00:05:55.404
un er hot gekrign dort UNK di PAPERS az se balangt tsu undz.

00:05:55.404 --> 00:05:57.755
iz a halbe shtub iz geven far a shul

00:05:57.812 --> 00:05:59.463
flegt men lernen kinder.

00:05:59.463 --> 00:06:00.439
a kheyder.

00:06:01.896 --> 00:06:04.370
un ver hot gevoynt bay dir in di shtub?

00:06:04.613 --> 00:06:06.007
nu, mayn FAMILY.

00:06:06.334 --> 00:06:08.268
ale brider un ale shvest-

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:08.269
yo, ale.

00:06:11.346 --> 00:06:12.819
