00:06:13.655 --> 00:06:18.461
ertseyln fun dayn kindheyt, vos du gedenkst als kleyn kind fun di heym?

00:06:19.277 --> 00:06:23.203
vu hostu geshpilt? vos far a SPIELZEUG hostu gehat?

00:06:22.973 --> 00:06:24.992
me fleg shpiln SOCCER GAME.

00:06:25.116 --> 00:06:26.780
UNK s'iz geven Poyln.

00:06:29.098 --> 00:06:33.867
in dayn gegnt, vos far a gegnt iz es geven, a yidishe gegnt ober gemisht?

00:06:34.127 --> 00:06:35.521
a yidishe gegnt.

00:06:35.697 --> 00:06:38.410
in Poyln in di shtot hobn gevoynt yidn

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.802
un oyf di derfer

00:06:39.802 --> 00:06:41.766
hobn gevoynt di FARMERS.

00:06:43.223 --> 00:06:48.178
vos hot dayn foter getun farn baruf? vos hot dayn foter UNK

00:06:46.598 --> 00:06:48.240
shusteray. gemakht sht-

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:49.342
gemakht shikh.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:52.178
