00:06:51.947 --> 00:06:54.810
NO, er hot gearbet far a magazin, far a gesheft.

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:57.914
un dayn mame, hot zi oykhet gearbet?

00:06:57.533 --> 00:06:59.079
zi flegt im helfn.

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:02.319
zi fleg brengen di materyal far di shikh

00:07:02.376 --> 00:07:04.085
un avekgtrogn di shikh.

00:07:04.085 --> 00:07:05.086
THAT'S ALL.

00:07:05.802 --> 00:07:08.361
un mayn bruder hot gearbet mit mayn foter

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:09.609
