00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:11.381
Berl.

00:07:12.855 --> 00:07:14.739
un ikh hob gearbet in Varshe.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:18.164
ikh bin alt geven zekhtsn yor, shoyn antlofn fun shtub.

00:07:18.492 --> 00:07:21.692
un far dem, ven du bist nokh geven a kleyn

00:07:21.715 --> 00:07:22.637
kind

00:07:22.862 --> 00:07:25.454
vos far a shule bistu geganen?

00:07:27.115 --> 00:07:31.429
s'iz nisht gevezn keyn ⟨nomen⟩. POWSZECHNA SZKOLA hot men dos gerufn, LIKE PUBLIC SCHOOL.

00:07:31.452 --> 00:07:32.644
BUT NO NAME.

00:07:33.628 --> 00:07:35.141
un vos hostu shtudirt?

00:07:36.784 --> 00:07:38.752
kh'hob nisht geFINISHED di shtudirn.

00:07:38.995 --> 00:07:41.402
bloyz finef y- CLASS.

00:07:43.264 --> 00:07:45.131
vos hostu gern gehat?

00:07:45.508 --> 00:07:46.227
ha?

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:48.978
tsu lernen? vos iz, vos hostu gern gehat tsu lernen?

00:07:49.508 --> 00:07:51.864
der TIME ⟨hot men⟩ nisht gehat vos tsu lernen.

00:07:52.562 --> 00:07:56.960
keyn HIGH SCHOOL iz nisht gevezn, COLLEGE iz nisht gevezn. ikh bin nokh geven tsu yung.

00:07:57.253 --> 00:07:59.879
bin ikh avekge- avekgeforn in Varshe un gearbet.

00:08:00.088 --> 00:08:03.502
un far dem bistu geganen in kheyder arayn?

00:08:02.704 --> 00:08:03.561
yo.

00:08:03.502 --> 00:08:05.246
ale hobn gan in kheyder

00:08:03.561 --> 00:08:05.229
vi iz

00:08:05.927 --> 00:08:06.725
un

00:08:06.725 --> 00:08:08.823
hostu gehat a bar mitsve oykh?

00:08:08.661 --> 00:08:09.397
ye

00:08:09.589 --> 00:08:11.810
nisht a bal mitsve LIKE THEY MAKE HERE

00:08:12.863 --> 00:08:15.034
vi nokh hobn zey gemakht? zog mir.

00:08:16.508 --> 00:08:18.307
bay dem rebn in shtub.

00:08:20.085 --> 00:08:22.003
ver iz, ver iz gekumen?

00:08:22.195 --> 00:08:24.028
nu, der noentster FAMILY

00:08:28.624 --> 00:08:32.313
vos iz geven, vi nokh hostu

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:34.560
gemakht di yontoyvim in di heym?

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:38.200
fartseyl mir vi nokh s'iz geven a peysekh bay dir in di shtub.

00:08:38.158 --> 00:08:39.957
LIKE SUPPOSED TO BE.

00:08:40.065 --> 00:08:41.814
LIKE REAL KOSHER.

00:08:43.386 --> 00:08:47.264
UNK mayn foter iz geven a shuster, hot men genumen di var- dem varshtot

00:08:47.423 --> 00:08:50.623
di TABLE vu er hot gearbet, avekgerukt alts in THE SIDE

00:08:50.899 --> 00:08:52.563
un zayne TOOLS

00:08:52.958 --> 00:08:55.112
un alts iz geven fardekt

00:08:55.303 --> 00:08:57.738
un gekashert di ⟨keyle⟩

00:08:57.738 --> 00:08:58.926
THE DISHES

00:08:59.269 --> 00:09:01.018
un gemakht peysekhdik.

00:09:01.092 --> 00:09:04.090
oyf peysekh fleg men koyfn undz naye shikh

00:09:04.247 --> 00:09:06.013
un naye UNDERWEAR

00:09:07.116 --> 00:09:10.367
tsvey mol a yor, oyf a peysekh UNK rosheshone.

00:09:12.938 --> 00:09:14.619
un shabes oyf di nakht

00:09:15.486 --> 00:09:19.901
vi, vi hostu gemakht a shabes oyf di nakht? vi hot dayn mame gemakht a shabes?

00:09:20.076 --> 00:09:21.909
YOU MEAN fraytik oyf di nakht?

00:09:21.949 --> 00:09:23.360
iz geven shabes.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:26.398
shabes oyf der nakht fleg men shpiln domines.

00:09:27.012 --> 00:09:28.997
ye, fleg men zikh tsuzamennemen.

00:09:30.117 --> 00:09:31.444
un fraytik?

00:09:31.618 --> 00:09:33.012
shabes esn?

00:09:31.939 --> 00:09:34.785
fraytik hot men gegan in shul arayn

00:09:34.909 --> 00:09:37.856
tsum davenen. nakher UNK gekumen un ale ge-

00:09:37.947 --> 00:09:39.510
geesn tsuzamen.

00:09:40.157 --> 00:09:43.402
ver s'iz nisht geven in shul hot nisht gekent ⟨tsukumen⟩ esn

00:09:43.402 --> 00:09:44.590
tsum TABLE.

00:09:45.068 --> 00:09:46.429
hot er gedorfn zayn

00:09:48.325 --> 00:09:51.981
m'hot gehat yeder eyner a opgekoyfte CHAIR. m'hot dos gerufn in shtot

00:09:52.071 --> 00:09:54.354
in shul. yeder eyner hot gehat zayn CHAIR

00:09:54.354 --> 00:09:55.473
UNK gekoyft

00:09:55.699 --> 00:09:59.085
LIKE HERE YOU BUY TICKETS. OVER THERE EVERYBODY HAVE HIS CHAIR.

00:09:59.732 --> 00:10:01.936
vu iz geven dayn shul?

00:10:02.584 --> 00:10:05.311
oyf velekher gas? oyf DLUGA gas.

00:10:05.959 --> 00:10:08.197
dos geven noent tsu dayn hoyz?

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:09.074
ye.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:14.812
s'iz, iz dos geven a groyse shul ober a besmedresh?

00:10:15.848 --> 00:10:20.966
di groyse shul iz geven vu ikh hob gevoynt, UNK LIKE EH FROM HERE TO HERE.

00:10:20.966 --> 00:10:22.130
NOT TOO FAR.

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:24.802
un den iz geven etlekhene bote medroshim

00:10:25.804 --> 00:10:27.519
un den iz geven khasidim.

00:10:27.643 --> 00:10:30.387
der Sokolover rebe hot gehat zayn eygene shul.

00:10:31.288 --> 00:10:33.040
der Sokolover rebe iz geven a

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:34.826
