00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:38.133
un di turme hot balangt tsu im, di POLICE.

00:10:39.085 --> 00:10:40.935
du gedenkst vi er hot geheysn?

00:10:41.025 --> 00:10:42.369
MORGNSHTERN.

00:10:44.569 --> 00:10:46.385
do iz geven zayner a zun.

00:10:46.543 --> 00:10:50.570
er hot gehat a eygene shul ON EH INDEPENCE BOULEVARD IN THE WEST SIDE.

00:10:51.133 --> 00:10:52.443
⟨veys tsi⟩ iz nokh do.

00:10:53.833 --> 00:10:56.324
kumstu aroys fun a frume familye?

00:10:56.719 --> 00:10:58.147
NO, LIKE EH

00:10:58.879 --> 00:11:00.206
EH TRADITIONAL

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:02.164
⟨BUT mir hobn⟩ derhaltn yidishkeyt.

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:05.505
hostu gehaltn kosher in di shtub oykhet?

00:11:04.684 --> 00:11:05.437
ye

00:11:08.937 --> 00:11:13.082
vi nokh bist adurkhgekumen mit dayn shvester un dayn bruder in di heym?

00:11:13.864 --> 00:11:14.718
nu

00:11:14.893 --> 00:11:18.009
zey hobn gehat ire khavertes. ikh hob gehat mayne khaveyrim.

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:20.034
vos far a khaveyrim hostu gehat?

00:11:20.209 --> 00:11:22.053
I TOLD YOU, LIKE IN EH

00:11:22.053 --> 00:11:24.624
SHOMER HATSAIR, un di rekhte POALE TSION

00:11:24.883 --> 00:11:27.729
ale mol getoysht, a mol tsu di revizyonistn

00:11:28.005 --> 00:11:32.352
fartseyl mir fun di tsaytn, vos, vos d'host getun tsuzamen, vos far a zakhn.

00:11:29.642 --> 00:11:30.209
n-

00:11:32.342 --> 00:11:36.284
me fleg kumen tsuzamen zingen UNK hebreishe lider

00:11:36.527 --> 00:11:37.921
un tantsn

00:11:38.012 --> 00:11:40.739
den hot men gehat a, a PING PONG TABLE

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:44.250
hot in droysn geshpilt VOLLEYBALL.

00:11:44.779 --> 00:11:46.578
hostu geshpilt oykhet?

00:11:46.045 --> 00:11:47.271
ye, VOLLEYBALL.

00:11:47.462 --> 00:11:49.903
vos iz geven dayn beste shpil?

00:11:50.314 --> 00:11:52.080
in Poyln? SOCCER GAME.

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:55.354
mit vem hostu geshpilt SOCCER?

00:11:55.798 --> 00:11:57.057
mit di polyakn.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:11:59.842
BUT zey

00:11:59.916 --> 00:12:02.525
THEY USED TO KICK YOU I- IN THE FOOT

00:12:02.667 --> 00:12:03.977
IN THE NERVES HERE

00:12:05.012 --> 00:12:06.693
THEY USED TO FIGHT BY PLAYING.

00:12:06.683 --> 00:12:08.010
ba- far vos?

00:12:08.016 --> 00:12:11.503
fa- bay, zey zenen goyim un undz ze'mir yidn.

00:12:11.492 --> 00:12:13.612
zey hobn gevust az du bist a yid?

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:13.932
ye.

