00:19:43.945 --> 00:19:45.829
vi nokh du bist antlofn?

00:19:45.615 --> 00:19:48.224
l- in di nakht hot men geWALKED.

00:19:48.535 --> 00:19:50.267
m'iz shtendik ge- ge-

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.961
geganen un geWALKED mit di GROUPS

00:19:52.961 --> 00:19:54.176
LIKE A LEADER

