00:20:14.033 --> 00:20:15.816
Shloyme WITTENBERG.

00:20:16.277 --> 00:20:20.338
un fun dort hob ikh shoyn geWALKED keyn SOKOLOV, a draysik kilometer.

00:20:20.952 --> 00:20:22.768
vi lang hot dos gedoyert?

00:20:22.487 --> 00:20:23.527
iber nakht.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:24.523
yo.

00:20:24.512 --> 00:20:29.163
in di tsayt v- vi du bist antlofn, hostu gezen di daytshn araynkumen?

