00:21:27.793 --> 00:21:29.525
m'hot gedorfn ⟨ariberloyfn⟩.

00:21:29.633 --> 00:21:32.647
fun Sokolov in di andere shtot, Byalistok.

00:21:33.058 --> 00:21:34.570
iz hot men

