00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:53.521
hob ikh shoyn geven geSAVED.

00:21:53.578 --> 00:21:56.052
ikh bin shoyn geven zikher ikh ⟨vel nishto⟩ bay di daytshn mer.

00:21:56.937 --> 00:22:01.177
in di tsayt ven du bist antlofn durkh Sokolov

00:22:01.177 --> 00:22:04.102
