00:22:11.753 --> 00:22:13.063
 SURE.

00:22:13.137 --> 00:22:14.481
zey hobn nisht gevolt geyn.

00:22:14.841 --> 00:22:16.725
un di brider un di shvestern?

00:22:16.798 --> 00:22:20.673
di shvester un di brider zenen geblibn. eyn bruder iz geven mit mir in Slonim.

00:22:21.321 --> 00:22:23.171
nakher hot men im derharget dort.

00:22:23.042 --> 00:22:25.246
velkher bruder iz dos gevezn?

00:22:24.088 --> 00:22:25.837
Berl, der elterer.

00:22:26.653 --> 00:22:28.436
er hot khasene gehat in Slonim.

00:22:29.050 --> 00:22:30.630
SO ven du bist

00:22:30.889 --> 00:22:34.173
aribergelofn di grenets oyf di rusishe za-

00:22:32.931 --> 00:22:35.051
⟨aribergefort⟩ mit a lotke.

00:22:35.597 --> 00:22:38.510
un, un di bist gekumen oyf di rusishe zayt

00:22:37.639 --> 00:22:38.544
yo

00:22:38.601 --> 00:22:41.058
vos hot pasirt den? vu bistu geganen?

00:22:41.858 --> 00:22:43.877
zenen mir arayngeforn in Byalistok.

00:22:44.068 --> 00:22:47.251
un in Byalistok hob ikh gefunen oykhet an arbet

00:22:47.562 --> 00:22:51.338
un fun dort hot men undz UNK hobn di rusn registrirt

00:22:51.338 --> 00:22:54.727
ale REFUGEES vos zenen aribergelofn fun di daytshe zayt

00:22:54.868 --> 00:22:59.452
du vilst voynen oyf di daytshe zayt tsi oyf di rusishe zayt, hot men undz registrirt

00:22:59.644 --> 00:23:02.810
hob ikh zikh registrirt keyn Rusland, hot men undz aribergefirt

00:23:02.935 --> 00:23:04.650
in a por vokhn arum

00:23:04.656 --> 00:23:07.282
keyn Vaysrusland, in Vitebsk.

00:23:07.525 --> 00:23:08.767
a groyse shtot

00:23:09.043 --> 00:23:11.180
un ot dort hob ikh gearbet shoyn.

00:23:11.035 --> 00:23:12.294
vos far a arbet?

00:23:12.013 --> 00:23:13.424
oykhet a shuster

00:23:13.735 --> 00:23:17.222
un eyn mol, NO, tsum ershtn hot men gearbet

00:23:17.430 --> 00:23:19.097
oyslodn

00:23:19.097 --> 00:23:21.440
lodn UNK

00:23:21.497 --> 00:23:24.461
breter, ⟨veyst⟩ dos iz LUMBER, aynlodn

00:23:24.838 --> 00:23:27.346
un dort hob ikh farshpetikt tsu di arbet

00:23:27.522 --> 00:23:30.773
tsen minut, hot men mir arayngerukt in turme far fir monat.

00:23:31.403 --> 00:23:32.224
ye.

00:23:31.858 --> 00:23:33.320
vu iz dos gevezn?

00:23:34.187 --> 00:23:37.556
in, in Vitebsk, oder in Slonim. ikh gedenk nisht.

00:23:37.579 --> 00:23:40.492
dos iz geven aza gezets fun Stalinen

00:23:40.752 --> 00:23:42.585
⟨az me⟩ farshpetikt tsu der arbet

00:23:42.928 --> 00:23:44.570
di ershte mol

00:23:44.570 --> 00:23:45.825
iz fir monat.

00:23:45.848 --> 00:23:47.394
kh'hob opgezesn in turme.

00:23:47.367 --> 00:23:49.436
dos iz geven azoy vi a tfise

00:23:49.797 --> 00:23:51.310
azoy vi a JAIL?

00:23:51.366 --> 00:23:53.486
a REAL JAIL, ye, in turme.

00:23:54.015 --> 00:23:55.291
un

00:23:55.585 --> 00:23:59.747
in di letste vokh, befor di aroysgeyn fun JAIL

00:23:59.955 --> 00:24:04.606
iz UNK hot men arayngenumen in di kantselarye in byuro zikh untershraybn a PAPER

00:24:04.697 --> 00:24:06.243
HOW THEY TREAT US

00:24:06.537 --> 00:24:10.317
THEY CHANGE THE MATTRESS EVERY WEEK, THEY GIVE US GOOD FOOD

00:24:10.317 --> 00:24:14.277
EVERYTHING WAS A, a lignt. m'hot nisht getoysht keyn matrats, hot men geshlofn oyf

00:24:14.277 --> 00:24:15.216
oyf di FLOOR.

00:24:15.216 --> 00:24:16.909
m'hot gedorfn untershraybn

00:24:17.117 --> 00:24:19.186
eyder m'hot aroysgelozt fun turme

00:24:19.210 --> 00:24:23.957
AND THEN IF THEY FIND OUT I SAY SOMETHING WRONG ABOUT THIS, I GET A YEAR turme

00:24:23.957 --> 00:24:25.296
hob ikh zikh untergeshribn.

00:24:26.719 --> 00:24:29.143
to in Rusland oykh bin ikh nisht gegan in di armey.

00:24:29.740 --> 00:24:33.936
m'hot mir gerufn tsu di komisye, un m'hot mir ge⟨UNK⟩. ikh bin gut far di armey

00:24:34.212 --> 00:24:39.144
un m'hot mir, kh'hob gedorfn kumen in dray teg nemen di militerishe UNIFORM

00:24:39.144 --> 00:24:41.174
bin ikh antlofn vayt geforn

00:24:41.417 --> 00:24:44.246
hunderter, toyznter kilometer, tif Rusland.

00:24:44.961 --> 00:24:46.355
vu bistu gelofn?

00:24:46.480 --> 00:24:48.752
ve- vi

00:24:46.513 --> 00:24:48.903
UNK

00:24:49.433 --> 00:24:51.823
bin ikh geforn vayter

00:24:53.145 --> 00:24:55.434
f- fun Vitebsk. ikh bin antlofn

00:24:55.474 --> 00:24:57.965
SARATOV, BALKHASH, T-

00:24:58.208 --> 00:25:00.632
KONS- KRASNOYARSK

00:25:00.722 --> 00:25:02.136
Azye.

00:25:02.136 --> 00:25:02.930
LIKE

00:25:02.930 --> 00:25:04.749
Sibirer STATE.

00:25:04.651 --> 00:25:06.285
mit vemen bistu gelofn?

00:25:06.325 --> 00:25:07.551
mit GROUPS.

00:25:08.130 --> 00:25:08.832
yo.

00:25:08.400 --> 00:25:10.706
un dayn bruder, vu iz er gevezn?

00:25:09.835 --> 00:25:12.782
er iz geven in Slonim. hot khasene gehat in Slonim.

00:25:13.142 --> 00:25:14.536
un

00:25:15.133 --> 00:25:17.686
i- in der ba- in der ban

00:25:17.686 --> 00:25:19.785
in di vagonen iz geven tsvey

00:25:20.128 --> 00:25:23.817
tsvey pletser tsu shlofn, oyfn ershtn, oyfn tsveytn shtok.

00:25:23.925 --> 00:25:25.556
do iz oykhet do azelkhe.

00:25:25.613 --> 00:25:29.471
hob ikh ⟨zikh⟩ aroyfgekrokhn in der heykh un zikh gemakht shlofndik

00:25:29.528 --> 00:25:33.622
un ikh hob getrogn a militerishn COAT, iz aruntergeganen

00:25:33.831 --> 00:25:38.702
kumt tsu, ikh bin opgeforn efsher a tsvey toyznt kilometer. kumt tsu geyn a konduktorke

00:25:39.962 --> 00:25:43.325
kontrolirn di TI- di, IF I HAVE A bilet, a TICKET.

00:25:43.500 --> 00:25:46.936
iz shlept, hot zi mir getsoygn farn, far dem paltn

00:25:46.960 --> 00:25:47.986
"hey, hey

00:25:47.986 --> 00:25:50.598
GRAZHDANIN," iz oyf rusish a birger

00:25:50.807 --> 00:25:55.374
"ah, kontrol, WAKE UP, WAKE UP." kh'hob zikh gemakht shlofndik

00:25:55.802 --> 00:25:57.090
UNK

00:25:57.090 --> 00:26:00.549
un zi hot nisht gev- zi hot nisht ge- nisht gevorn mid shteyn bay mir.

00:26:00.549 --> 00:26:02.580
geshlept un geshlept baym JACKET

00:26:02.772 --> 00:26:06.360
"kontrol, kontrol. vayz ⟨ir⟩ a TICKET." ikh hob nisht keyn TICKET.

00:26:07.851 --> 00:26:09.515
veystu vos ikh hob getun?

00:26:09.927 --> 00:26:11.693
⟨az zi⟩ zol avekgeyn.

00:26:12.880 --> 00:26:14.966
efsher nisht sheyn tsu dertseyln dos

00:26:15.529 --> 00:26:17.177
kh'hob ir gegebn a BLOW

00:26:17.689 --> 00:26:19.623
in in ir FACE

00:26:19.731 --> 00:26:22.090
UNK iz zi avekgelofn, makht zi

00:26:22.090 --> 00:26:23.910
"fe, s'iz nisht sheyn"

00:26:24.270 --> 00:26:27.571
un iz avekgegan. iz zi mer nisht gekumen bay mir, bin geforn an andere

00:26:27.578 --> 00:26:30.477
fuftsn hundert kilometer, tsvey toyznt kilometer.

00:26:30.477 --> 00:26:31.701
nakher hob ikh gehat a

00:26:31.701 --> 00:26:34.237
geTRIED vi tsu kumen BACK

00:26:34.362 --> 00:26:37.683
in farnumenem gebit oyf Rusland un Poyln.

00:26:37.683 --> 00:26:40.818
hob ikh dort getrofn mayn bruder, un dort hob ikh geven in geto.

00:26:41.415 --> 00:26:43.957
vu hostu getrofn dayn bruder?

00:26:42.833 --> 00:26:43.974
in Slonim.

00:26:44.588 --> 00:26:46.826
SO du bist tsurik

00:26:45.094 --> 00:26:46.843
er hot khasene gehat dort.

00:26:47.203 --> 00:26:49.188
SO du bist tsurikgekumen?

00:26:48.098 --> 00:26:49.492
tsurikgeforn, yo

00:26:49.515 --> 00:26:53.086
⟨bin⟩, m'iz geforn tsurik, iz men geforn biz Kiev

00:26:53.262 --> 00:26:55.477
un in Kiev iz geven

00:26:55.477 --> 00:26:56.782
di ukrayner

00:26:57.058 --> 00:26:59.072
armey, di soldatn.

00:26:59.072 --> 00:27:03.009
zey hobn undz aribergefirt di grenets in farnumenem gebit in Poyln

00:27:03.066 --> 00:27:05.540
oder Ukrayne oder Vaysrusland.

00:27:05.935 --> 00:27:08.291
ikh bin nokh a- aribergekumen in Slonim.

00:27:08.567 --> 00:27:10.198
ven iz dos gevezn?

00:27:10.677 --> 00:27:12.628
UNK nayntsn eyn un fertsik

00:27:13.056 --> 00:27:14.383
ven

00:27:14.507 --> 00:27:18.196
ikh denk in eyn un fertsik, hot ongefangen di milkhome mit Rusland.

00:27:18.574 --> 00:27:19.344
yo.

00:27:19.384 --> 00:27:24.356
in di tsaytn hostu gevust vos pasirt mit di yidn in Poyln?

00:27:23.248 --> 00:27:25.014
in POLAND SURE hot men gevust.

00:27:24.565 --> 00:27:25.892
vos hostu gehert?

00:27:26.337 --> 00:27:27.242
⟨m'hot⟩ gehert

00:27:27.585 --> 00:27:33.825
fun di, Varshe ale yidn, fun ⟨ale yidn⟩, m'hot arayngefirt in di shuln, dort gesh-

00:27:33.825 --> 00:27:36.590
zey hobn dort geshlofn. m'hot zey ale kontsentrirt dort

00:27:36.850 --> 00:27:39.881
un nakher hot men zey avekgefirt in lagern. SURE hot men gevust.

00:27:40.512 --> 00:27:43.647
d'host gevust in di tsaytn fun di lagern oykhet?

00:27:43.363 --> 00:27:44.150
ye

00:27:43.647 --> 00:27:45.568
velekhe lager hostu gevust fun

00:27:44.545 --> 00:27:47.104
damolst iz geven arbets lagern

00:27:47.177 --> 00:27:49.128
nisht keyn farnikhtungs lagern.

00:27:51.463 --> 00:27:52.373
un

00:27:51.463 --> 00:27:54.781
m'hot gearbet oyf di shoseyen oysglaykhn di vegn

00:27:55.193 --> 00:28:00.216
un di daytshe soldatn flegn marshirn, durkhgeyn, flegn zey undz gebn a kope UNK

00:28:00.508 --> 00:28:04.332
ye, un vayter, un g- un geshrign tsu undz "di yidn zenen shuldik in di krig"

00:28:05.048 --> 00:28:06.527
dos vos zey hobn geshrign.

00:28:07.444 --> 00:28:11.195
m'vet yetst oyfhey- oyfheybn a minutn mit

00:28:11.195 --> 00:28:12.942
vekslen di TAPE, OKAY?

00:28:12.304 --> 00:28:13.162
OKAY.
